  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Development Cooperation Engagement  Initiative - 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for development cooperation is a central communication goal for the minister for development and global climate policy. Popular support is relatively stable at around 60% of the population. However, it is also clear that the public knowledge of development in the world&apos;s poorest countries is still limited. And with the increasing number of Danes who actively avoid following the news flow, the rise of AI and SoMe&apos;s echo chambers and ability to mass spread fake news, there is a risk of increased apathy and distrust of international cooperation present. Therefore, there is a need for new methods and approaches if we are to reach the general population with our messages. This initiative should help create the opportunity for that.</narrative>
  </description>
